        "transcript": [
          "Speaker 1 @0.0s [en]: Good morning everyone. Thanks for joining the weekly planning meeting for the mobile app redesign.",
          "Speaker 2 @7.9s [en]: Morning. I reviewed the design files yesterday and I have a few concerns about the onboarding flow.",
          "Speaker 1 @15.0s [en]: Okay, let's start there. What is the main problem you noticed?",
          "Speaker 2 @18.9s [en]: The sign up screen asks for too much information up front.",
          "Speaker 2 @23.5s [en]: Most people will abandon it before they finish.",
          "Speaker 1 @26.6s [en]: That makes sense.",
          "Speaker 1 @28.0s [en]: Could we move the profile questions to a later step after the first login?",
          "Speaker 2 @33.6s [en]: Yes, I think that would work.",
          "Speaker 2 @36.2s [en]: We would only ask for an email address and a password at the beginning.",
          "Speaker 1 @40.9s [en]: Great.",
          "Speaker 1 @42.2s [en]: Then let's decide that the sign up screen will only collect email and password.",
          "Speaker 2 @47.1s [en]: Agreed.",
          "Speaker 2 @48.6s [en]: I will update the wire frames and share them with the team before Thursday.",
          "Speaker 1 @53.0s [en]: Perfect.",
          "Speaker 1 @54.3s [en]: The next topic is the notification settings.",
          "Speaker 1 @57.7s [en]: Customers keep asking for a quiet mode during the weekend.",
          "Speaker 2 @61.8s [en]: We could add a simple toggle in the settings page.",
          "Speaker 2 @64.6s [en]: It should be easy to build.",
          "Speaker 1 @67.0s [en]: I like that idea, but we need to check with the backend team about scheduling.",
          "Speaker 2 @74.0s [en]: I can talk to Omar about it this afternoon and I will report back tomorrow.",
          "Speaker 1 @78.5s [en]: Thank you.",
          "Speaker 1 @79.8s [en]: Another item is the performance of the dashboard.",
          "Speaker 1 @90.0s [en]: It still takes several seconds to load on older phones.",
          "Speaker 2 @95.0s [en]: I measured it last week. Most of the delay comes from loading every chart at the same time.",
          "Speaker 1 @99.8s [en]: So should we load the charts only when the user scrolls to them?",
          "Speaker 2 @104.2s [en]: Exactly. Lazy loading should cut the waiting time roughly in half.",
          "Speaker 1 @109.7s [en]: All right. Let's make lazy loading the priority for the next sprint.",
          "Speaker 2 @114.9s [en]: Sounds good. Should we also invite the support team to the next review?",
          "Speaker 1 @118.7s [en]: Yes, please send them an invitation. Their feedback about customer complaints would be really helpful.",
          "Speaker 2 @124.5s [en]: We'll do. Is there anything else we need to cover today?",
          "Speaker 1 @127.8s [en]: I think that is everything. Thanks everyone, and see you next week."
        ]
      },
